        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Depending on the client’s needs, we can provide any or all elements of the service, including (i) token issuance, (ii) smart contract management, and (iii) reserve custody and administration that hold and manage assets backing stablecoins with automatic rebalancing, daily reconciliation, and compensation attestations from top accounting firms.",
